  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A proton, moving with initial velocity <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span>, enters an electric field between two parallel, horizontal plates near the surface of the Earth. The velocity of the proton does not change as it moves through the electric field. What is the direction and the best estimate for the magnitude of the electric field between the plates?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Electric field direction between the plates</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Magnitude of electric field between the plates</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td>Upwards</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"100\"></span> nN C<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td>Upwards</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"10\"></span> nN C<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td>Downwards</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"100\"></span> nN C<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td>Downwards</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"10\"></span> nN C<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
